{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21203","headline":"酬乐天劝醉 · 元稹","name":"酬乐天劝醉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神麯清浊酒，牡丹深浅花。\n少年欲相饮，此乐何可涯。\n沈机造神境，不必悟楞伽。\n酡颜返童貌，安用成丹砂。\n刘伶称酒德，所称良未多。\n愿君听此曲，我爲尽称嗟。\n一杯颜色好，十盏胆气加。\n半酣得自恣，酩酊归太和。\n共醉真可乐，飞觥撩乱歌。\n独醉亦有趣，兀然无与他。\n美人醉灯下，左右流横波。\n王孙醉牀上，颠倒眠绮罗。\n君今劝我醉，劝醉意如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21203.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21203","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}